 "_comment": "Chat-free skilling: integer XP-delta \u2192 resource token, the POWER-SKILLING fallback (item dropped on a full inventory \u2192 no itemId). RuneLite's StatChanged.getXp() is the FLOORED integer career total, so a fractional base (oak 37.5) surfaces as alternating +37/+38 deltas \u2014 hence fractional bases have BOTH the floor and ceil integer as keys pointing to the same token (37\u2192oak, 38\u2192oak). Keyed by the raw integer XP delta. STRING value = unambiguous token \u2192 <token>+<suffix>. {\"members\":[...]} = a TRUE collision (>1 keyed resource share this delta) \u2192 server bumps only the generic total + logs the tuple; the itemId path resolves these exactly when banking. Suffixes: WOODCUTTING\u2192LogsChopped, MINING\u2192Mined, FISHING\u2192Caught, COOKING\u2192Cooked. Verified vs OSRS Wiki 2026-07-18. Unknown delta \u2192 generic+log, then add a row (hot-reloaded). || AGILITY / HUNTER / HUNTER_BIRDHOUSES / FARMING values are FULL counter keys read verbatim by their code branches (the original four skills stay token+family-suffix). FIREMAKING types the consumed-capture misses; the consumed-item path stays primary.",
